	(text "Current limit: I_LIM = 3334 / R_ILM (A, Ω). Measure R_ILM on the 2 mm header\nwith the board unpowered and set it with the trimpot. Keep R_ILM ≤ 6.65 kΩ (I_LIM ≥ 0.5 A).\nPG asserts when OUT rises above 10.2 V and drops below 9.27 V.\nOVLO turns the output off when IN rises above 15.8 V and back on below 14.4 V."
